---
description: Baseline agent conventions for redroid-cloud-phone
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read `AGENTS.md` (repo instructions) and `.AGENT/agent.md` at the start of work.
- This repo is part of the `knowshowgo +8` environment; the canonical cross-repo
  handoff is `osl-oc-agent/.AGENT/handoffs/CURSOR-ENV-HANDOFF.md`.
- Gitflow: branch from the integration branch, PR back into it, one logical
  change per branch. Do not merge PRs or push to protected branches unless told.
- Never print or commit secret values. Prefer editing existing files.
- Keep `.AGENT/agent-action-log.md` current as you work.
